{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S5ANENTYY5ZAHN6gpaAJSj","type":"tool_result","content":"619:- `saves.autosave(o)` †: save to the autosave (what write() gives)\n621:- `saves.erase(slot)` †: erase a slot\n623:- `saves.latest()` †: the most recent save that loads, or null (a title's Continue loads it)\n624:- `saves.list()` †: every slot, the autosave first: [{ slot, empty, place, level, time, at, damaged, newer }] (a menu's rows)\n625:- `saves.load(slot)` †: load a slot: its data brought up to this version (migrate), played set from it, read(save) called. Returns the save ({ data, place, level, time, slot }), or null when the slot is empty, damaged or from a newer version\n633:- `saves.read` †: what a load does with { data, place, level, time, slot }\n636:- `saves.write` †: what a save holds ({ data, place, level })","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6eb1a01c-ab9c-4627-8921-fbc800f925bb","uuid":"519b75a5-71d6-49ba-a7ed-f28c159e3028","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:07:59.190Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"619:- `saves.autosave(o)` †: save to the autosave (what write() gives)\n621:- `saves.erase(slot)` †: erase a slot\n623:- `saves.latest()` †: the most recent save that loads, or null (a title's Continue loads it)\n624:- `saves.list()` †: every slot, the autosave first: [{ slot, empty, place, level, time, at, damaged, newer }] (a menu's rows)\n625:- `saves.load(slot)` †: load a slot: its data brought up to this version (migrate), played set from it, read(save) called. Returns the save ({ data, place, level, time, slot }), or null when the slot is empty, damaged or from a newer version\n633:- `saves.read` †: what a load does with { data, place, level, time, slot }\n636:- `saves.write` †: what a save holds ({ data, place, level })","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01S5ANENTYY5ZAHN6gpaAJSj","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
